Private single-game process-lifetime shutdown; apply AFTER native-launch.patch.
Main: af91e3bf56b1ffc329ff4327fdc2380515463de7
N64ModernRuntime: cd6dc4a349215563595141b4493384baf21975a1

IDLE acknowledges cooperative quiescence before the final EEPROM snapshot.
Join persistent writers and save native settings before status-bearing _Exit.
Retain RDRAM, worker contexts, loaded mod code and queues until process death.
This does not provide in-process restart, forced cancellation or fsync durability.

